... here, the power percentage of Legendary Cat Shield (maximum +50% Initial Health) activated by these Treasures is:

<math>\dfrac{1\cdot1 + 2\cdot2 + 0\cdot3}{3\cdot3} = 55.56\%</math> or +27.77% Initial Health (as shown but rounded down in-game).

In this example a level 1 [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] with Initial Health of 100 would be treasure boosted by 55% of +50% Health.

The level 1 Cat's new health is now 127.

There are three Empire of Cats chapters each containing a Legendary Cat Shield, so the effect of obtaining each of those three sets at maximum power gives 100%, 200% or 300% Legendary Cat Shield power, that would increase the Initial Health of [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] to 150, 200 or 250 at level 1. (an increase of +50%, +100% or +150%)

