==Tips==
*Treasure set effects carry over to all stages, so obtaining and maximizing their effect is a vitally important part of the game.
*Treasure Festivals for [[Cats of the Cosmos]] are rare, so grind as much as you can when one appears.
*Since most stages give you the same amount of points for the Treasure Gauge when you beat them, no matter their energy cost, replaying low-energy-cost stages like [[Korea (Empire of Cats)|Korea]] or [[Mongolia (Empire of Cats)|Mongolia]] is a good way to fill the Treasure Gauge without having to spend a lot of energy in the process.

==Trivia==
*[[The Aku Realms]] are the only main chapter without any Treasures to unlock.
*In [[Ganso!! Nyanko Daisensou]], Inferior Treasures were gray, Normal Treasures were pink and Superior Treasures were orange and green.
*In [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]], Treasure icons have the kanji for treasure, 宝 (''takara''), instead of a star.
